ON SFP Module 2.5G C++++ 9dBm is a cutting-edge optical transceiver designed to deliver high-speed data transmission and superior performance for GPON networks. With a robust +9dBm optical output power, this 2.5G SFP module is perfect for service providers, telecom companies, and enterprises looking to expand or upgrade their fiber optic network infrastructure.</p><p><br></p><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li>2.5G GPON SFP Module: This Gigabit Passive Optical Network (GPON) module supports 2.5 Gbps downstream speed, ensuring smooth and fast internet connections for end-users in fiber-to-the-home (FTTH) or fiber optic broadband networks.</li><li>+9dBm Optical Power: With an output power of +9dBm, the module offers reliable long-distance transmission over single-mode fiber (SMF), minimizing signal loss and enhancing overall fiber optic network performance.</li><li>Hot-Swappable SFP Form Factor: The Small Form-factor Pluggable (SFP) design enables easy installation, hot-swapping, and maintenance-free operation, making it an ideal choice for network upgrades and expansions.</li><li>Wide Compatibility: Fully compatible with GPON Optical Line Terminals (OLTs) and Optical Network Units (ONUs), this SFP module ensures seamless integration into existing GPON infrastructure.</li><li>Cost-Effective Solution for GPON Networks: Offering a high-performance solution at a competitive price, this VSOL SFP module is ideal for budget-conscious telecom operators and network engineers.</li><li>Durable and Reliable: Engineered for high durability, the VSOL GPON PON SFP module is designed to perform reliably in a variety of environmental conditions, ensuring consistent optical signal transmission for years to come.</li></ul><p><br></p><h4><b>Applications:</b></h4><ul><li>Telecom Providers &amp; Internet Service Providers (ISPs): Perfect for expanding high-speed fiber-optic GPON network solutions.</li><li>Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) Networks: Ideal for connecting homes and businesses with high-speed fiber broadband.</li><li>Business &amp; Enterprise Fiber Networks: A reliable choice for businesses seeking to upgrade or deploy fiber optic connections for better performance.</li></ul><h4><b><br></b></h4><h4><b>Why Choose the VSOL GPON PON SFP Module 2.5G 9dBm?</b></h4><p>The VSOL 2.5G GPON PON SFP Module offers exceptional value for anyone looking to enhance the performance of their fiber optic network. With advanced features like hot-swappability, high optical power, and compatibility with GPON equipment, it is a versatile solution for telecom networks, FTTH deployments, and fiber broadband infrastructure.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/ecom-epon-olt-pon-sfp-module-125g-px20\">ECOM EPON OLT PON SFP Module 1.25G PX20++++</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">2,200৳</span> \n                                <span 